  "Cooldown Time: 6 actions\\nIncrease all allies' ATK based on $1 ATK (Up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK) for $3 turns. When using this skill, spend 1 <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link> if you have any <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link> (Prioritizing higher quality <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link>). Spending [<link\\=\"s|182\"><u>Tailor-Made</u></link>/<link\\=\"s|183\"><u>Standard</u></link>/<link\\=\"s|184\"><u>Basic</u></link>] increase the effect by $4/$5/$6 respectively.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Cocktail drinkers are all visual creatures, and the ingenious touches bring an experience beyond taste, so in the name of blessing, let's let the guests get drunk.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Cooldown Time: 4 actions\\nIncrease 1 ally's DMG Dealt (Every $1 ATK give $2 DMG Dealt, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK) and increase Max HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> for 2 turns. The target restore $5 damage as HP when dealing damage for 1 turn. Spend 1 [<link\\=\"s|184\"><u>Basic</u></link>/<link\\=\"s|183\"><u>Standard</u></link>] to gain 1 <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Balanced taste, or add Mixer, compared to the aggressive alcohol, the fusion of art has created a cup of God.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Invigorating Blend Lv.$1": "",
  "Invigorating Blend <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Cooldown Time: 8 actions (cannot be used when Yumi doesn't have <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link>)\\nSpend all Cocktails to increase party's attribute damage based on the targeted ally's <color\\=#FFFC40>attribute</color> for $8 turns. Increase damage by $5 for every $4 of Yumi's Attack (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> ATK). <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>[Standard]</u></link>, and <link\\=\"s|184\"><u>[Basic]</u></link> Cocktails will increase damage by an additional $1, $2, and $3 respectively. Increase effects on targeted ally by 1.2 times. If 2 or more <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link> or <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>[Standard]</u></link> Cocktails are spent, increase targeted ally's Crit DMG by $7.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The impact of chaos and disorder, the boldness of brutality, the elegance of calculation ...... Wine is not a high or a low wine, take a sip and enjoy this exclusive gift.</color></size></b>": "",
