  "At the start of battle, randomly gain <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> <link\\=\"s|181\"><u>[Mixer]</u></link> based on allies' element.": "",
  "At the start of battle, for each non-Wonder character with the same attribute, increase those characters' ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. If there are 3/2 characters with the same attribute, increase their Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>/<color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>. When Yumi gains <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>[Standard]</u></link>, and <link\\=\"s|184\"><u>[Basic]</u></link> Cocktails, increase party's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color>, <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color>, and <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> respectively for $4 turns. Stacks up to $5 times.": "",
  "At the start of battle, for each non-Wonder character with the same attribute, increase those characters' ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>. If there are 3/2 characters with the same attribute, increase their Pierce by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>/<color\\=#0169ca>$3</color>. When Yumi gains <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>[Standard]</u></link>, and <link\\=\"s|184\"><u>[Basic]</u></link> Cocktails, increase party's damage by <color\\=#0169ca>$6</color>, <color\\=#0169ca>$7</color>, and <color\\=#0169ca>$8</color> respectively for $4 turns. Stacks up to $5 times.": "",
