  "XYZ": "",
  "The maximum number of <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link> stacks increases to $1. At the start of battle, gain 1 <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link> Cocktail. After every $2 <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktails]</u></link> mixed, gain 1 more <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link> Cocktail. \\nWhen spending a <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>[Standard]</u></link>, or <link\\=\"s|184\"><u>[Basic]</u></link> Cocktail to activate a skill, increase the skill effect from $3/$4/$5 up to $6/$7/$8 (includes [Tempting Build], [Invigorating Blend], and [Moonlit Banquet]).": "",
  "Increase <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> allies' ATK based on $1 ATK (Up to $2 ATK) for 3 turns. When using this skill, spend 1 [Cocktail] to increase the effect (Prioritizing high-quality [Cocktail]). Spending [Tailor-Made/Standard/Basic] increase the effect by $3/$4/$5 respectively.": "",
  "Preparation Time: 6 actions\\nIncrease all allies' ATK based on $1 ATK (Up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK) for 3 turns. When using this skill, spend 1 <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link> if you have any <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link> (Prioritizing higher quality <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link>). Spending [<link\\=\"s|182\"><u>Tailor-Made</u></link>/<link\\=\"s|183\"><u>Standard</u></link>/<link\\=\"s|184\"><u>Basic</u></link>] increase the effect by $3/$4/$5 respectively.": "",
  "Increase <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> ally's DMG Dealt (Every $1 ATK give $2 DMG Dealt, up to $3 ATK) and increase Max HP by $4 for 2 turns. The target restore $5 damage as HP when dealing damage for 1 turn. Spend 1 [Basic/Standard] to gain 1 [Tailor-Made].": "",
  "Preparation Time: 4 actions\\nIncrease 1 ally's DMG Dealt (Every $1 ATK give $2 DMG Dealt, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK) and increase Max HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> for 2 turns. The target restore $5 damage as HP when dealing damage for 1 turn. Spend 1 [<link\\=\"s|184\"><u>Basic</u></link>/<link\\=\"s|183\"><u>Standard</u></link>] to gain 1 <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link>.": "",
  "Spend all Cocktails to increase <color\\=#FFFC40>party's</color> attribute damage based on the targeted ally's <color\\=#FFFC40>attribute</color> for $8 turns. Increase damage by $5 for every $4 of Yumi's Attack (up to $6 ATK). [Tailor-Made], [Standard], and [Basic] Cocktails will increase damage by an additional $1, $2, and $3 respectively. Increase effects on targeted ally by 1.2 times. If 2 or more [Tailor-Made] or [Standard] Cocktails are spent, increase targeted ally's Crit DMG by $7.": "",
